        <ul class="compact-list">
          <li><b>Local Cache VLAN 50:</b> Tự chạy DNS Split-Horizon, RADIUS, hàng đợi backup 2TB HDD.</li>
          <li><b>Wi-Fi 6 Roaming 802.11k/v/r:</b> Min RSSI −72 dBm, kênh 1–6–11 / 36–44–149.</li>
          <li><b>Bảo mật L2/L3:</b> Sticky MAC, DHCP Snooping, ACL 140/150/199, SSHv2 &amp; SNMP.</li>
          <li><b>QoS DSCP &amp; TLS 1.3:</b> LLQ 30% cho VoIP/iCLASS; Wireshark kiểm chứng mã hóa 443.</li>
